@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Verification & Safety";
}

<section class="container py-5" style="max-width:900px;">

<h1 class="display-5 mb-4">
Verification & Safety
</h1>

<p class="lead text-muted">
UpliftBridge aims to support real people while protecting donors and recipients.
</p>

<hr class="my-4"/>

<h3>Manual review</h3>

<p>
Needs may be manually reviewed before publication.
Additional information may be requested when needed.
</p>

<h3>Verification approach</h3>

<ul>

<li>Basic contact verification</li>

<li>Community review when applicable</li>

<li>Institution-based support preferred</li>

<li>Official payment destinations encouraged</li>

</ul>

<h3>Payment safety</h3>

<p>
UpliftBridge does not process need donations.
Need donations are completed directly with schools,
vendors, organizations or official payees where applicable.
</p>

<h3>Report concerns</h3>

<p>
If you believe content is misleading,
unsafe or inaccurate,
please contact us.
Content may be reviewed,
paused or removed.
</p>

<div class="alert alert-light border mt-4">

Kindness works best with trust.

</div>

</section>